        - Includes layer 50 for sram vt implant in the core area 
        - Leaf cell port names have been changed to have port name
          correspondence between the schematic and layout.
        - Text have been stripped from leaf cells to avoid spurious
          text causing problems with lvs and hierarchical lvs.
        - Calibre LVS might report ERC pathcheck errors for some memory
          instances.  Those errors are verified and can be ignored
          An example error report is replicated below.
          ra1shd_304x2m8 1000
          ERC PATHCHK POWER && ! GROUND
          1 1 0 Mar  8 16:23:28 2002
          p 1 4
          79955 20785
          81145 20785
          81145 20815
          81230 20815
          Please contact Artisan for more Information.
          
