    o LVS/GDS2
        - LVS view generator creates <instance_name>.hcell which can
          be used for Calibre hierarchal lvs.
        - GDS2 view generator includes a macro boundary layer (gds2
          layer 230:0).  This layer is a dummy marker layer used for
          CAD purposes such as metal density checking or to exclude
          dummy pattern filling. It covers the memory macro, but
          excludes the ring area.
        - GDS2 text layer 63:63 is allocated by TSMC for IP marking.
        - GDS2 layer 6:0 is OD versus previous Artisan technologies
          where PDIF and NDIF were on gds2 layers 7:0 and 8:0. 

